0, "client_id": 1022101, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/efd6a784/uploads/origins/429df5be-ebb7-41cf-9d82-d3706c002a84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99118f0184445f8b59fc7ba74c3fed07", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/efd6a784/uploads/origins/429df5be-ebb7-41cf-9d82-d3706c002a84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28279729c8d3f7b8f3311dc4a93259b0", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, I love your art style!! I really like the coloring. \n\nI would like to request an illustration of my favorite VTuber, Essie.\nShe is a sleepy sheep girl with a stuffed sheep stuffed toy.\n\nPlease be as creative as you would like!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/u9Xw9R9\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/u9Xw9R9", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/38", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 3517150, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5441a75/uploads/origins/465ff72c-c526-477d-83d8-663453a682ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9688699fe90fc41145c29145613df3f6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5441a75/uploads/origins/465ff72c-c526-477d-83d8-663453a682ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=31d9cd8569e4f2d899bf951f4a680702", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi れいみ様, I’d like to request my character. She’s a lonely girl with an appearance of a kid. She is a weak, frail and innocent kid but also strange and gloomy. I would like to have her drawn or interpreted by you based on the song https://youtu.be/v5BloiCJCys?si=WuQ9rrepzO5fk8_m (ヘブンズバグ - いよわ) if that’s possible! If it’s not , I would love for you to just draw her as you like. Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nElvzSdBGPZNK9ZDLwpIBGuWPs2lipma", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/37", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 1394852, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0f84687/uploads/origins/27519cea-3cd6-4610-acd8-5c0dd0681e9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=deb74b5625334295d75793f8e4bd6710", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0f84687/uploads/origins/27519cea-3cd6-4610-acd8-5c0dd0681e9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7dc2b8428cdffe60a68c36f6081f055", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Dear Reimi, Nice to meet you!\nMay I request my Vtuber character if possible?\n\nThe character is based on Sea bunny (Sessile Sea Slug).\nThe character is an underwater nudibranch empress, and her hobby is collecting bones.\nAnd she likes TRPGs, burgers, retro games, stealing bones, napping, and nudibranchs.\nPlease feel free to pose me in any way you like.\nIf you like, you are free to choose other costumes as well.\n\nI want to use them for Twitch and social networking and stuff! m(_ _)m\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1e8NxVySA0DhhyPtpWcDCAvkLxutDDD3X", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/36", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 901774, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed71ba38/uploads/origins/16f36310-160d-4d7e-a4f8-c7a0e5d18cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e07dd0c9ef5ecb58aaaec9ad9faed5c7", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed71ba38/uploads/origins/16f36310-160d-4d7e-a4f8-c7a0e5d18cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dfeda200f4022c781ac7b23291dc666e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, it's nice to meet you! Your art is really cute!!💕  \n\nMay I request my VTuber NUE, would you please draw him in this outfit? https://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/73317864_IWFbpqAEVYpPKzd.png \nThis child is X-gender.  \n\nPlease draw freely! \n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/8052709.nue/gallery", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/35", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 2362213, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b3c8c76/uploads/origins/46e0b274-448c-4102-aacc-2c7fcf4de1c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64a0ad6f785ddcaaca6623b59c34546a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b3c8c76/uploads/origins/46e0b274-448c-4102-aacc-2c7fcf4de1c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a9b4edecc9efe2a1402af1b471ea670", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, I truly love your art and think your style is beautiful!! I really like how you draw faces.\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my character. She is a strange and soft angel who likes fabric and birds.\n\nI'd be very happy if you drew her in any way that you'd like.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IT_pIFedkTofEz9-VYnF-ykfjSNQA7b?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IT_pIFedkTofEz9-VYnF-ykfjSNQA7b?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/34", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 2552913, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e393fdf/uploads/origins/53fb7c0d-8024-490f-b326-6d39a213a12a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eec92cf03c637f353b599f5e265966b0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e393fdf/uploads/origins/53fb7c0d-8024-490f-b326-6d39a213a12a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91ef9432b74c6e4ab0bfaa0a8857dbae", "src_set": ""}, "body": "It is nice to meet you! I fell in love at first sight with the illustrations that Reimi-sensei draws, and I would like to contact you in the hope that I can commission you for this project. The minimum width is 640 pixels and the aspect ratio is 16:9. [Illustration details] I would like to request a thumbnail of the song \"Haruganakainai Machi\" by Walking Man. https://youtu.be/Gp3tQIVPFjY?si =-The background and facial expressions can be left up to you! We are looking for a character who is dressed in uniform! Character data: https://lit.link/rorurou", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 2852406, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ac133e1/uploads/origins/b8d47a1f-b1b5-42f3-a549-58220205f4be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=131997d25ccd8067d6816c283816ad93", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ac133e1/uploads/origins/b8d47a1f-b1b5-42f3-a549-58220205f4be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=99280a7b8a523ac1001a464df3e5c09c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "れいみ様、初めまして。\nもしご都合がよろしければ、私のVtuberキャラを描いていただけると嬉しいです。\n\n● キャラクターの参考情報\n寄宿学校に通う温和でおっとりした文学女子です。お嬢様の割にはかなりオタクです。好きな物はレトロゲーム、お絵描き、美術館巡りです。\n\n● 利用用途\n・配信用のサムネイルでの使用\n・SNSでの掲載、またはアイコン・ヘッダーとしての使用\n\nイラストの内容などは、参考情報をもとにれいみ様におまかせしたいと思います。\n\nお忙しいところ恐れ入りますが、ご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10SsUbOpLjIeAn5QvrMR--yWfGEi661h7", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/32", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 3488550, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d24b2eb/uploads/origins/ea6697a4-0fd9-4f19-a968-53801d63c674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0208417a41eb33619cf23edf83f5518", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d24b2eb/uploads/origins/ea6697a4-0fd9-4f19-a968-53801d63c674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fad856499a673a809c0b52b6152b5aaa", "src_set": ""}, "body": "いつも見ています。もうすぐ大好きな人の誕生日なので是非描いてもらいたいと思いました。描いてもらうことは了承済みです。その人は私の光で希望で愛です。元々〝ヒヨルナ〟というアイドルグループで活動していて、今はハンドメイドやイベントに細々と活動してます。そのこのイメージは、淡いピンク、白、真実、愛、リボン、フリル。といった感じです。\nどんなイラストお願いしようか迷ったのですが、あなたの感性が好きなので、あなたが感じたまま描いてほしいです。\n\nそのこは、cumurixx(くむり)、という名前です。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/31", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 946118, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/91c1d333/uploads/origins/efa23836-71ec-4580-a4d9-e416aa2bc5a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06cd7cc5d2d639cc20576f2f1410bbd0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/91c1d333/uploads/origins/efa23836-71ec-4580-a4d9-e416aa2bc5a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=841528e2de9e900d3705a41452b220eb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Good evening,\nI've seen your art and fell in love with it. \nI hope you will accept to draw my bear VTuber Freya. \n\nShe is a guild receptionist who is very big sister-like.\nThe composition is completely up to you.\n\nHere are my references:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nhsTfuI4bjvgZ1p3I3XGgX3LNVSViEDr?usp=drive_link\n\n\nI want to use the artwork for Vtuber activies & SNS.\nThank you", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/30", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 1785985, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/40361f77/uploads/origins/77320e30-331e-4d38-a2c0-e1e6ee93e5f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50e4c5c8a7f285b5f740648b829f72ce", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/40361f77/uploads/origins/77320e30-331e-4d38-a2c0-e1e6ee93e5f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7aa44a5b430d0aa703fde9bf2119e7b4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I really loved your last illustration of my character!\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/requests/1549521\n\nPlease draw my Vtuber digi_shell. She is a tamagotchi princess. \nShe is a melancholic girl that has a mysterious, quiet personality with a sad smile.\nI like these two pieces you drew the most:\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@r_i_m_000/works/9\nhttps://skeb.jp/@r_i_m_000/works/6\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/15YSuHvTX5mF50Q9mqkFxzrHygSySfsuc", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/29", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 3370158, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/350f7d33/uploads/origins/43a3bc51-430c-4e48-ae20-1b7be52464ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7db390c1bb3421bbb1a10e2fc00476d9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/350f7d33/uploads/origins/43a3bc51-430c-4e48-ae20-1b7be52464ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=573b08fe5785131537100fa21c659c81", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんばんは🌙\nイラスト本当に素敵でskeb依頼したいと思って送りました✨️\n\n髪色:薄紫にピンクのインナー)\n髪型:三つ編み(出来れば)\n目の色:右目:水色、左目:ピンク\n\n全然れいみちゃんの好きなように描いてくれて、大丈夫です！\n初めて依頼するのでなにか間違えとかあったらすみません😭", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/28", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8f65e6e/uploads/origins/75df7d87-d621-4f76-9e0d-362ec9223788?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=45b1f267ad4eb5ffbcb371dd6fdbaa08", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 3351019, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "con