ransparent png version too that would be great!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-amFer8fWMx9y2LOGFy8AVaF45vwUMgn?usp=share_link", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 846315, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8bcff4a1/uploads/origins/dfc5a522-485b-4efc-91fb-9f3f699377cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da3428cff2e2b12526c7ce95b56e6cfe", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8bcff4a1/uploads/origins/dfc5a522-485b-4efc-91fb-9f3f699377cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f5898554aafd2e188d810308ab99b170", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Nice to meet you, Reimi!\nI really love Reimi's style, and if you don't mind, I'd love to have you draw one of my creative characters here!\n\nI really love your style and I would like to draw this character if it's okay with you!\nI would like to have a crying face/natural/expressionless/childish face.\nI would like her to wear a sailor uniform and a maid's uniform (sailor uniform + apron design, more frills would be nice).\nBackgrounds and accessories are all optional.\n\nYou may change any part of the character design, so please draw the character as you like.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1a7LmxJvHyTfM7xEgATZ2BaFAwBQ9Gxte", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1571220, "client_id": 2137769, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/af6536d3/uploads/origins/82e7aab9-dd5a-41c9-83eb-3c